{
    "title": "Backgammon: Dice Board Game",
    "description": "Welcome to Backgammon Classic, one of the most popular board games in the world!\r\n \r\nStrategy, skills and good planning will be key to master the game.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 How to play?\r\n\u2022\tThe objective of the game is to be the first player to move all the checkers into their home board and bear them off\r\n\u2022\tThe roll of the dice indicates how many points, you can move your checkers\r\n\u2022\tRoll a double to play twice\r\n\u2022\tHit your opponent\u2019s checkers to remove them from the board\r\n\u2022\tUse the doubling cube to increase the stakes at any point\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Why choose Backgammon Classic?\r\n\u2022\tStart playing right away with a single touch\r\n\u2022\tTailored for mobile and tablet devices\r\n\u2022\tEasy to play with a modern and relaxing look\r\n\u2022\tSmart and adaptive opponent AI\r\n\u2022\tPlay in 1 or up to 15 points\r\n\u2022\tDouble the stakes anytime \r\n\u2022\tChoose the controls\r\n\u2022\tAuto save so that you can resume whenever you want\r\n\r\nBackgammon is completely FREE to play, enjoy now hours of exciting card games!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Backgammon Classic, one of the most popular board games in the world!<br> <br>Strategy, skills and good planning will be key to master the game.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb2 How to play?<br>\u2022\tThe objective of the game is to be the first player to move all the checkers into their home board and bear them off<br>\u2022\tThe roll of the dice indicates how many points, you can move your checkers<br>\u2022\tRoll a double to play twice<br>\u2022\tHit your opponent\u2019s checkers to remove them from the board<br>\u2022\tUse the doubling cube to increase the stakes at any point<br><br>\ud83c\udfb2 Why choose Backgammon Classic?<br>\u2022\tStart playing right away with a single touch<br>\u2022\tTailored for mobile and tablet devices<br>\u2022\tEasy to play with a modern and relaxing look<br>\u2022\tSmart and adaptive opponent AI<br>\u2022\tPlay in 1 or up to 15 points<br>\u2022\tDouble the stakes anytime <br>\u2022\tChoose the controls<br>\u2022\tAuto save so that you can resume whenever you want<br><br>Backgammon is completely FREE to play, enjoy now hours of exciting card games!",
